{"content":[{"id":"tpl-intent-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Intent","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"08edd918-94bd-460e-bece-8ebb354b0caf","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[],"children":[]},{"id":"a0dab1ea-01bf-4ce6-a418-ad67a45543a2","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"ster of the legal entities FCY faces","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"2483ab0c-efda-4b72-a2e2-87f5b9ae762f","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Open Questions","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"c57f2855","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"A central register of the legal entities FCY faces — the counterparties, funds and booking entities the firm trades with — each identified by its name and its Legal Entity Identifier (LEI). It realises the CDM type ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"cdm.base.staticdata.party.LegalEntity","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":" as this deployment's persisted entity, so that standing rule FCY R7 (\"identify every counterparty as a CDM Party with an LEI in partyId; no free-text counterparty names\") has a source of truth to point at. It serves traders, operations and any future trade or legal-agreement feature that must reference a legal entity rather than a free-text name.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-scope-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Scope","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"af2c51d4","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"IN:","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"07959e69","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"One ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"LegalEntity","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":" bean — name plus exactly one required LEI — with the platform's standard search screen and edit form.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"255b9136","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Seeding of the register with the firm's existing counterparty population (~40 active counterparties, each with its LEI).","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"136cb6bd","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"OUT (non-goals):","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"a7a98155","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The CDM ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"Party","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":" type, party roles and trade-level counterparty roles (","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"Counterparty","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":", ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"AncillaryParty","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":", ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"PartyRole","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":") — a later spec.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"2b3192d3","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"LegalAgreement","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":" stack (master agreements, annexes) — a later spec.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"9af0b1bb","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Any link from a legal entity to trades or agreements — none exists yet.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"5cc9aee6","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"LEI validation against the GLEIF registry — the register stores the identifier; it does not verify it live.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-scenarios-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Scenarios","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"0c4e54cd","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"None — the bean's standard screens cover the journeys (create, edit, browse, seed); no ordered process beyond them.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-requirements-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Requirements","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"d12b94be","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"R1: WHEN the register is first delivered, the system SHALL be seeded with a hardcoded seed list of the firm's existing counterparty population (~40 active counterparties), each row carrying its name and its LEI. The hardcoded list is test data for now; it is replaced when the author supplies the real counterparty list.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-datamodel-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Data model","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"c43b01bf","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Realises the CDM root entity ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"cdm.base.staticdata.party.LegalEntity","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":" (vocabulary, from the cdm corpus), narrowed to this firm's need: CDM allows ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"LegalEntity","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":" with no identifier and many identifiers; FCY requires exactly one LEI per entity (FCY standing rule R7).","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"50ea8324","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":3,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"bean: LegalEntity","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"e11c030f","type":"table","props":{"textColor":"default"},"content":{"type":"tableContent","rows":[{"cells":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"field","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"kind","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"required","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"notes","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}}]},{"cells":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"name","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"text","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"yes","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"the legal entity's name","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}}]},{"cells":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"lei","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"text","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"yes","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"unique; format(20 alphanumeric); the Legal Entity Identifier","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}}]}],"columnWidths":[null,null,null,null],"headerRows":1},"children":[]},{"id":"a4aaa5b1","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Relationships: none yet — trades and legal agreements will reference this entity in later specs.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"0d09b4ca","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Rules the table cannot carry: none — every rule is in the table above.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"87917e03","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Artifacts: ","styles":{}},{"type":"link","href":"#spec-attachment/entity_descriptors/cdm.base.staticdata.party.LegalEntity.json","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Entity descriptor","styles":{}}]},{"type":"text","text":" · ","styles":{}},{"type":"link","href":"#spec-attachment/ui/cdm.base.staticdata.party.LegalEntity.js","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Default form","styles":{}}]}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-ui-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"User interface","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"95b7293c","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The bean's standard search screen and edit form. No custom look requested.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-dependencies-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Dependencies","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"c91e0761","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"cdm.base.staticdata.party.LegalEntity","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":" (vocabulary, from the cdm corpus) — the CDM type this bean realises; its ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"EntityIdentifier","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":" list is narrowed to a single required LEI field.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"2b5042a2","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"FCY standing rule R7 (from the company corpus) — the business rule that motivates the required, unique LEI.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"ac33192c","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"No existing platform entity is reused: the entity catalog holds no legal-entity or party entity, and no registered spec covers this ground.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-constraints-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Constraints","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"8c51383f","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Considered, none apply beyond the platform's own rules: authorization (any signed-in user reads and writes — the platform default), volume (~40 rows, far below platform limits), availability, audit (platform audit trail), privacy, locale, cost.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-acceptance-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Acceptance criteria","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"c797c075","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"A1 (verifies R1): WHEN the first delivery completes, the search screen SHALL return the seeded counterparties — at least 40 rows, each with a non-empty 20-character LEI — including a named spot-check entity agreed with the author.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-migration-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Migration & compatibility","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"bf17d157","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"New entity, nothing to migrate. The register is seeded on first delivery with the firm's existing counterparty population (~40 active counterparties, each with its LEI) as initial rows; the seed list is HARDCODED for now as test data (author's decision) and is replaced when the real list is supplied. No existing rows, users or callers are affected.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-artifacts-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Artifacts","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"8d29bf52","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"A ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"LegalEntity","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":" entity with its observer sheet, default listing and default form, and the seed of the existing counterparty population.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"8892acad","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":3,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Derived from the Data model","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"af9dd150","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Implied by the bean blocks in the Data model and regenerated by the platform - do not edit this block; author above it what the catalog cannot derive.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"1d5c7d83","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"LegalEntity - persistence.entity (persistence): The entity class with its builder, its descriptor + jsontype entry, its migration and table, and its tests; the descriptor is authored at spec time as the bean's entity-descriptor attachment (entity_descriptors/{qualified-descriptor-name}.json).","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"9f10e194","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"LegalEntity - observer.sheet (observer): The observer sheet: the entity's only remote surface, reads and writes.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"38d1139d","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"LegalEntity - ui.defaultForm (ui): The default form of one row, rendered wherever the row is viewed or edited: its layout JS, authored at spec time as the spec's ui/{qualified-descriptor-name}.js attachment and shipped beside the entity class.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"0baa625e","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"LegalEntity.lei - validation.rule (persistence): unique - enforced on save and covered by a generated test","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"2d3a2ae8","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"LegalEntity.lei - validation.rule (persistence): format(20 alphanumeric) - enforced on save and covered by a generated test","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-openq-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Open Questions","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"c7a1a9fe","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"None — the seed source is decided: the seed list is hardcoded for testing until the author supplies the real counterparty list (author's decision, this session).","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"10cb5369-46be-44d1-8e24-a83efea45b13","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[],"children":[]}],"comments":[]}